#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi pakej\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod pada halaman ini dibangunkan menggunakan keperluan berikut.\n"
"Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan versi ini atau yang lebih baharu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To facilitate the development and reuse of custom transpilation code by the wider community of Qiskit users, the Qiskit SDK supports a plugin interface that enables third-party Python packages to declare that they provide extended transpilation functionality accessible via Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Untuk memudahkan pembangunan dan penggunaan semula kod transpilasi tersuai oleh komuniti pengguna Qiskit yang lebih luas, Qiskit SDK menyokong antara muka plugin yang membolehkan pakej Python pihak ketiga mengisytiharkan bahawa mereka menyediakan fungsi transpilasi lanjutan yang boleh diakses melalui Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Currently, third-party plugins can provide extended transpilation "
"functionality in three ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada masa ini, plugin pihak ketiga boleh menyediakan fungsi transpilasi "
"lanjutan dalam tiga cara:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A [transpiler stage "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) provides"
" a pass manager that can be used in place of one of the [6 "
"stages](transpiler-stages) of a preset staged pass manager: `init`, "
"`layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization`, and `scheduling`.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Plugin peringkat "
"Transpiler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) "
"menyediakan pengurus laluan yang boleh digunakan sebagai ganti salah satu "
"daripada [6 peringkat](transpiler-stages) pengurus laluan berperingkat "
"pratetap: `init`, `layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization`, dan "
"`scheduling`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A [unitary synthesis "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin)"
" provides extended functionality for unitary gate synthesis.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Plugin sintesis "
"uniter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin)"
" menyediakan fungsi lanjutan untuk sintesis Gate uniter.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A [high-level synthesis "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin)"
" provides extended functionality for synthesizing \"high-level objects\" "
"such as linear functions or Clifford operators. High-level objects are "
"represented by subclasses of the "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)"
" class.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Plugin sintesis peringkat "
"tinggi](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin)"
" menyediakan fungsi lanjutan untuk mensintesiskan \"objek peringkat tinggi\""
" seperti fungsi linear atau operator Clifford. Objek peringkat tinggi "
"diwakili oleh subkelas kelas "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The rest of the page describes how to list available plugins, install new "
"ones, and use them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selebihnya halaman ini menerangkan cara menyenaraikan plugin yang tersedia, "
"memasang yang baharu, dan menggunakannya.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available plugins and install new ones {#list-available-plugins-and-"
"install-new-ones}"
msgstr ""
"Senaraikan plugin yang tersedia dan pasang yang baharu {#list-available-"
"plugins-and-install-new-ones}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit already includes some built-in plugins for transpilation. To install "
"more, you can use your Python package manager. For example, you might run "
"`pip install qiskit-toqm` to install the [Qiskit "
"TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm) routing stage plugin. A "
"number of third-party plugins are part of the [Qiskit "
"ecosystem](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit sudah menyertakan beberapa plugin prabina untuk transpilasi. Untuk "
"memasang lebih banyak, anda boleh menggunakan pengurus pakej Python anda. "
"Sebagai contoh, anda mungkin menjalankan `pip install qiskit-toqm` untuk "
"memasang plugin peringkat penghalaan [Qiskit "
"TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm). Sebilangan plugin pihak "
"ketiga adalah sebahagian daripada [ekosistem "
"Qiskit](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available transpiler stage plugins {#list-available-transpiler-stage-"
"plugins}"
msgstr ""
"Senaraikan plugin peringkat Transpiler yang tersedia {#list-available-"
"transpiler-stage-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins)"
" function, passing the name of the stage whose plugins you want to list.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan fungsi "
"[list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins),"
" hantar nama peringkat yang plugin-nya ingin anda senaraikan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
" If `qiskit-toqm` were installed, then `toqm` would appear in the list of "
"`routing` plugins.\n"
msgstr ""
" Jika `qiskit-toqm` dipasang, maka `toqm` akan muncul dalam senarai plugin "
"`routing`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available unitary synthesis plugins {#list-available-unitary-synthesis-"
"plugins}"
msgstr ""
"Senaraikan plugin sintesis uniter yang tersedia {#list-available-unitary-"
"synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names)"
" function.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan fungsi "
"[unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available high-level synthesis plugins {#list-available-high-level-"
"synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr ""
"Senaraikan plugin sintesis peringkat tinggi yang tersedia {#list-available-"
"high-level-synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names)"
" function, passing the name of the type of \"high-level object\" to be "
"synthesized. The name corresponds to the "
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name)"
" attribute of the "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)"
" class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan fungsi "
"[high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names),"
" hantar nama jenis \"objek peringkat tinggi\" yang hendak disintesiskan. "
"Nama tersebut sepadan dengan atribut "
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name)"
" kelas "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)"
" yang mewakili jenis objek yang disintesiskan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the "
"[HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager)"
" class to list the names of all high-level synthesis plugins:\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menggunakan kelas "
"[HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager)"
" untuk menyenaraikan nama semua plugin sintesis peringkat tinggi:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a plugin {#use-a-plugin}"
msgstr "Gunakan plugin {#use-a-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this section, we show how to use transpiler plugins. In the code "
"examples, we use plugins that come with Qiskit, but plugins installed from "
"third-party packages are used the same way.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam bahagian ini, kami menunjukkan cara menggunakan plugin Transpiler. "
"Dalam contoh kod, kami menggunakan plugin yang disertakan dengan Qiskit, "
"tetapi plugin yang dipasang daripada pakej pihak ketiga digunakan dengan "
"cara yang sama.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a transpiler stage plugin {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"
msgstr "Gunakan plugin peringkat Transpiler {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use a transpiler stage plugin, specify its name with the appropriate "
"argument to "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" The argument is formed by appending `_method` to the name of the "
"transpilation stage. For example, to use the `lookahead` routing plugin, we "
"would specify `lookahead` for the `routing_method` argument.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menggunakan plugin peringkat Transpiler, tentukan namanya dengan "
"argumen yang sesuai kepada "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" atau "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" Argumen dibentuk dengan menambahkan `_method` pada nama peringkat "
"transpilasi. Sebagai contoh, untuk menggunakan plugin penghalaan "
"`lookahead`, kami akan menentukan `lookahead` untuk argumen "
"`routing_method`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The  `FakeSherbrooke` mock backend from `qiskit_ibm_runtime` is used in these examples, but you can try it on any Qiskit-compatible real or fake backend.  Your results might be different.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Backend tiruan `FakeSherbrooke` daripada `qiskit_ibm_runtime` digunakan dalam contoh-contoh ini, tetapi anda boleh mencubanya pada mana-mana Backend sebenar atau palsu yang serasi dengan Qiskit. Keputusan anda mungkin berbeza.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a unitary synthesis plugin {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr "Gunakan plugin sintesis uniter {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use a unitary synthesis plugin, specify its name as the "
"`unitary_synthesis_method` argument to "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menggunakan plugin sintesis uniter, tentukan namanya sebagai argumen "
"`unitary_synthesis_method` kepada "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" atau "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Unitary synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and `optimization` "
"stages of the staged pass manager returned by "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or used in "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these "
"stages.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sintesis uniter digunakan dalam peringkat `init`, `translation`, dan "
"`optimization` pengurus laluan berperingkat yang dikembalikan oleh "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" atau digunakan dalam "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" Lihat [Peringkat Transpiler](transpiler-stages) untuk penerangan peringkat-"
"peringkat ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config` argument, a free-form dictionary, "
"to pass options for the unitary synthesis method. The documentation of the "
"synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this "
"list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-"
"synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in unitary "
"synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan argumen `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config`, kamus bentuk bebas, untuk"
" menghantar pilihan bagi kaedah sintesis uniter. Dokumentasi kaedah sintesis"
" harus menerangkan pilihan yang disokongnya. Lihat [senarai "
"ini](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-"
"synthesis-plugins-2) untuk pautan ke dokumentasi plugin sintesis uniter "
"prabina.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a high-level synthesis plugin {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan plugin sintesis peringkat tinggi {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-"
"plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, create an [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) to\n"
"store the names of the plugins to use for various high-level objects. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, cipta [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) untuk\n"
"menyimpan nama plugin yang hendak digunakan untuk pelbagai objek peringkat tinggi. Sebagai contoh:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This code cell creates a high-level synthesis configuration that uses the `layers` plugin\n"
"for synthesizing [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) objects and the `pmh` plugin for synthesizing\n"
"[LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction) objects. The names of the keyword arguments correspond to the\n"
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) attribute of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
"For each high-level object, the list of given plugins are tried in sequence until one of them\n"
"succeeds (in the example above, each list only contains a single plugin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Sel kod ini mencipta konfigurasi sintesis peringkat tinggi yang menggunakan plugin `layers`\n"
"untuk mensintesiskan objek [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) dan plugin `pmh` untuk mensintesiskan\n"
"objek [LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction). Nama argumen kata kunci sepadan dengan\n"
"atribut [`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) kelas [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) yang mewakili jenis objek yang disintesiskan.\n"
"Untuk setiap objek peringkat tinggi, senarai plugin yang diberikan dicuba secara berurutan sehingga salah satunya\n"
"berjaya (dalam contoh di atas, setiap senarai hanya mengandungi satu plugin).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to specifying\n"
"a plugin by its name, you can instead pass a `(name, options)` tuple, where the second element of the tuple is a dictionary containing options for the plugin. The documentation of the synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in high-level synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selain menentukan\n"
"plugin mengikut namanya, anda boleh menghantar tuple `(name, options)`, di mana elemen kedua tuple ialah kamus yang mengandungi pilihan untuk plugin. Dokumentasi kaedah sintesis harus menerangkan pilihan yang disokongnya. Lihat [senarai ini](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) untuk pautan ke dokumentasi plugin sintesis peringkat tinggi prabina.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once you have created the `HLSConfig` object, pass it as the\n"
"`hls_config` argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah anda mencipta objek `HLSConfig`, hantarnya sebagai\n"
"argumen `hls_config` kepada [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) atau [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"High-level synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and "
"`optimization` stages of the staged pass manager returned by "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or used in "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these "
"stages.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sintesis peringkat tinggi digunakan dalam peringkat `init`, `translation`, "
"dan `optimization` pengurus laluan berperingkat yang dikembalikan oleh "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" atau digunakan dalam "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" Lihat [Peringkat Transpiler](transpiler-stages) untuk penerangan peringkat-"
"peringkat ini.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendation\">\n"
"- [Create a transpiler plugin](/guides/create-transpiler-plugin).\n"
"- Check out the [tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) for examples of transpiling and running quantum circuits.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"    - [Cipta plugin Transpiler](/guides/create-transpiler-plugin).\n"
"    - Lihat [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) untuk contoh transpilasi dan menjalankan Circuit kuantum.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
